    <item>
      <title>paw 0.1.0-beta.13</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:44:11 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>101</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0-beta.13</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<style>body{font:13px -apple-system,sans-serif;margin:12px 14px;color:#222}h3{font-size:13px;margin:12px 0 4px}ul{padding-left:18px;margin:4px 0}li{margin:2px 0}code{font:12px ui-monospace,monospace}a{color:#0a64d0}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#ddd}a{color:#6ab0ff}}</style><h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>add <code>join</code> to move a window into its neighbour's tile as a row (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/paw/commit/6fe1364cce0bd59151b0db84a342c5b02b0b111c">6fe1364</a>)</li>
<li>add indicator themes and a live preview in Settings (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/paw/issues/50">#50</a>) (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/paw/commit/26143e23a9e5e3f19cc33fa416cc8aa853b95374">26143e2</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>dock:</b> harden the Dock helper and its uninstall (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/paw/commit/bc4b41e8b2aed52311dfd29c28faf434c915f401">bc4b41e</a>)</li>
<li><b>dock:</b> restart the helper daemon in place when reinstalling (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/paw/issues/46">#46</a>) (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/paw/commit/442a5191abf930eda7cc6977dc948e8d4082512e">442a519</a>)</li>
<li><b>focus:</b> prevent hover focus through native dialogs (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/paw/issues/48">#48</a>) (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/paw/commit/efc0e1016ee0166a6cab9add45d9342e93117717">efc0e10</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h3>Performance</h3>
<ul>
<li>keep the main thread off slow apps and cut redraw work (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/paw/issues/52">#52</a>) (<a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/paw/commit/8b0002483091cbd485fb25157d0006ddbea4dd28">8b00024</a>)</li>
</ul><p><a href="https://github.com/pseudobun/paw/releases/tag/v0.1.0-beta.13">Release on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
